cts:@flow 15: #-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cts:@@flow 16: set_db design_process_node            45
cts:##  Process: 45            (User Set)               
cts:##     Node: (not set)                           
cts:
cts:##  Check design process and node:  
cts:##  Design tech node is not set.
cts:
cts:Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 45nm process node: total_c_th=0, relative_c_th=1 and coupling_c_th=0.1.
cts:	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
cts:	Capacitance filtering mode(extract_rc_cap_filter_mode option of the set_db) is 'relative_and_coupling' for all engines.
cts:	The accuracy mode for post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction will be set to 'high'.
cts:	Default value for EffortLevel(extract_rc_effort_level option of the set_db) in post_route extraction mode is 'medium'.
cts:@flow 17: if {[get_feature -feature flow_express]} {...}
