opt_signoff:Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 45nm process node: total_c_th=0, relative_c_th=1 and coupling_c_th=0.1.
opt_signoff:	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
opt_signoff:	Capacitance filtering mode(extract_rc_cap_filter_mode option of the set_db) is 'relative_and_coupling' for all engines.
opt_signoff:	The accuracy mode for post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction will be set to 'high'.
opt_signoff:	Default value for EffortLevel(extract_rc_effort_level option of the set_db) in post_route extraction mode is 'medium'.
